ullName": "Corinne Burghardt \ud83c\udfe1 \u2728 Slay At Home Mother", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-13", "plays": 5184, "likes": -1, "comments": 0}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "By the way, it used to be, oh, the homeschool kids were quote-unquote weird. No, no, no. Homeschool kids are wise. They're gonna be more polite, smarter, wiser, happier, more direction, more purpose, less corrupted, more understanding, more battle-ready, better prepared, less confused, more biblical, more grounded, more Christ-like if you are homeschooled. Homeschool your kids if you can. Homeschool your kids. If they're scorning you or they're saying bad things to you, blessed are you who are persecuted in my name, it says James 1.5. The homeschool kids, they're gonna be the ones that are gonna be running society. My money's on the homeschool kids.", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "DdEOr5PREks", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdEOr5PREks/", "caption": "Not skipping to Christmas just yet over here \ud83d\ude45\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\ude06 - because Autumn \ud83c\udf42 is my favorite season.\n\nI could be cliche and say how much I love the changing leaves and colors, the way the cold air feels in the morning, how much I don\u2019t love the daylight savings change, blah blah. \ud83d\udc81\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udc4b\n\nAnd - those are all true. \ud83d\ude18\n\nBut I really love the sense of decorating my home for Fall, too.\n\nThis is one of my favorite fall crafts - takes minutes on the Cricut and you can save and reapply these cute cardstock  bats for years. \ud83e\udd87 \n\nI stick with black cardstock, but feel free to change yours to whatever color you like! They stick out really nice against my white range hood.\n\nComment \u201cBATS\u201d \ud83e\udd87 and I\u2019ll send you the full blog post with my design space \ud83d\udd17, as well as the wall putty I use!\n\n#fallcrafts #crafts #cricut #wallbats #iamanautumn", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:16:04.000Z", "vide