shortCode": "DdAcGpexoKX", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdAcGpexoKX/", "caption": "Have you seen these necklaces in the store? We saw a couple and I figured I could TOTALLY make one for our little cheerleader this year \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude4b\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\n\nHere\u2019s what I used: \n- EVA craft foam (2mm thick)\n- loose leaf binder rings (.75 inch)\n- plastic chain necklace (I had a gold and a purple one, I undid the rings and arranged them in a gold/purple/gold/purple pattern \ud83d\ude09)\n- glue\n- thin magnets to hold down the foam while I cut it\n\nMy laser cut super nice edges for me - I\u2019m already thinking about what else we can make with foam! \n\nLaser: Nova Plus 35 60W from @thunderlaserusa \n\nComment \u201c\u26a1\ufe0f\u26a1\ufe0f\u26a1\ufe0f\u201d\ud83d\udc47 for my settings and laser deets! \ud83d\ude0d\n[thunder laser partner]", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T00:50:05.000Z", "videoDuration": 34.166668, "videoPlayCount": 1718, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 14, "commentsCount": 10, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/799855756_18428972503178865_4282251497491707987_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=Mzk4MTMwNTY3Mjc1NDQzMDYxNTE4NDI4OTcyNTAwMTc4ODY1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEzMjAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=gowWH7chZ6EQ7kNvwGuwcv_&_nc_oc=AdoQQnC6iww41ni_TTizPgu0AwPU8Xddld1Sk9qprU0--xIIY93BdptaIT8BLPy6iIA&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=qEo5hueUWE7p58lhJiV8YQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKBF8AtwHbAnpCxPH-gehWibadb3f1zMIMtHG8veKOxDQ&oe=6AACA170", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fpaz4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNy35Arqu_KqD1LCzsCNRZU3tsRUlL--NlBI3C6eAJnCfy1Hmm2z9I34cq-piAMhgiT4wPvU493zBl5npMJpZGbNgl-FZx0y4CGGKo.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdpGsfqmy4jBLUb7sNE_8-K8FQ4ROXDNAsFcllUHa2x9hwYPeVzUcFtyK12y67d-ytKb1kjyAsjwoRlBOK9hP2Ur&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fpaz4-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Gb7uljAgcbgQ7kNvwE7vdoS&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTA0NDEzMDY1ODM5MzU1NSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjYsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjozNCwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=7a34e618428f4872&_nc__DPs-jaAxUCKAJDMywXQEEVP3ztkWgYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=_nNVZ9Wk4SpBKwtobUfyGA&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQLz7Fmm9e4bxNV-pps9UL4VOfn-9fDJcqk4fy8l6vqgGw&oe=6AA88A33", "ownerUsername": "slayathomemother", "ownerFullName": "Corinne Burghardt \ud83c\udfe1 \u2728 Slay At Home Mother", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-13", "plays": 1718, "likes": 14, "comments": 10}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Deja Vu, deja vu.", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "Dc6ZoHZuvJy", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dc6ZoHZuvJy/", "caption": "The closer I get to YHWH, the more I realize that growth doesn\u2019t always feel good.\n\nSometimes the pain comes from growing.\n\nSometimes it comes from growing apart.\n\nAnd if I\u2019m being transparent, some of what I\u2019ve walked through over the last few years really shook my confidence.\n\nIt made me question myself in ways I hadn\u2019t before. I replayed conversations. Wondered what I could have done differently. Questioned how people saw me and, at times, even let that affect how I saw myself.\n\nAnd one of the hardest things I\u2019m learning is that not everything needs my defense.\n\nWhen you feel misunderstood, there\u2019s such a strong urge to set the record straight. To explain your side. To confront. To demand answers. To make sure people know what really happened.\n\nBut Jesus already knows.\n\nHe saw the conversations I wasn\u2019t in.\nHe saw the intentions behind the actions.\nHe saw what hurt.\nHe saw my own heart, too.\nAnd He knows the whole story better than I ever could.\n\nThere is so much freedom in realizing I don\u2019t have to chase down every misunderstanding or fight to control someone else\u2019s version of me.\n\nAnd slowly, I\u2019m learning to rebuild my confidence somewhere much steadier - not in being liked, understood, included, or validated by everyone, but in knowing who I am in Christ.\n\nI can keep walking. Keep growing. Keep asking God to refine my heart and trust Him with the rest.\n\nThrough all the twists and turns, I\u2019m incredibly grateful for the people God has placed beside me - the ones who have loved me well, prayed for me, encouraged me, and reminded me who I am when I struggled to remember it myself.\n\nEspecially my husband, who has been my rock through all of it. \ud83e\udd0d\n\nI\u2019m still learning. Still growing. Still being humbled.\n\nBut I\u2019m learning that whether I\u2019m walking through the pain or celebrating the good, I\u2019d rather be close to Jesus than understood by everyone.\n\nHe saw it.\n\nAnd that\u2019s enough for me. \ud83e\ude77\ud83d\ude4f\n\n#YHWH #christianmom #JesusisLord\u2764\ufe0f", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T16:35:02.000Z", "videoDuration": 11.066667, "videoPlayCount": 25713, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 1099, "commentsCount": 7, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fbne6-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/794032626_18428674441178865_679926310591627090_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=Mzk3OTYwNTkyODYyNDk3NjQ5ODE4NDI4Njc0NDM1MTc4ODY1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=p_bVHRpXWaIQ7kNvwFLgUN1&_nc_oc=AdrdBYC2g8CoV6mY7xVZ6yUVAVQP8LfFB-XHonELqtRf4H7wwbFdOLe3toaCW7zjMqds1oOZY-EAO7T-64yuS_iN&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fbne6-1.fna&_nc_gid=Xm4o9RwFGrVfrmuoBliIPw&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKqv3trd7BoCvlNUqgJBxzyloM0jtzsx8adSurrIHdiMA&oe=6AAC7EB5", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fbne6-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNvHjbf2kYQTB8KYKOoVJHhVw2VcIYD3Y16FmiepY5pr01KbIPogPgoWdoKFG46CApsA7fajcyE7vHxCveoHN9QfC8L4-m0oQG7z5s.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc